            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average technology\n\n# Included processes\nThe inventory includes the actual energy consumption for an average goods train in Europe using electric energy. No diesel consumption and emissions of shunting processes are accounted for. But the production and maintenance of vehicles and railyway tracks are included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
